WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Dad said that my brother is his son

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,640
I am also his son

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:03,960
So he is my biological brother

4
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,560
Mom, go take a rest first

5
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,520
How about you play by yourself?

6
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,560
It must be that you misunderstood last time and you haven’t seen your brother yet.

7
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,400
Haoyan didn't come back because he was angry

8
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,400
Mom, that's for you

9
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,800
But you don't believe me at all

10
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:22,950
I already told you that I accidentally broke my head and you still scolded my brother for not scolding him. What happened to you?

11
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:24,110
Why did the spacecraft monitoring suddenly stop?

12
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,390
Everything is normal now

13
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:26,630
May be a line or signal problem

14
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:27,670
Let's check it out right away

15
00:00:27,670 --> 00:00:33,100
Recover as soon as possible

16
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,660
It seems there is nothing mentally wrong

17
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:53,110
How long should we monitor?

18
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:54,460
uncle's house

19
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:55,900
Not to look at the power system

20
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:56,900
Went to the kitchen again
